TSA Timestamp Verification
==========================

This project uses Trusted Timestamp Authority (TSA) services for code integrity
verification and non-repudiation:

  - 联合信任时间戳服务中心 (tsa.cn)
  - DigiCert Timestamp Service

Timestamp certificates and verification instructions are available alongside
the relevant source files.

